subject_definitions:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: a 45-year-old male property manager, the only man in the clip. Slightly overweight, slicked-back oily hair, round face, an ingratiating smile that flips into a scowl, white shirt buttoned up to the closed collar under a dark grey buttoned waistcoat, dark grey trousers and black leather shoes. His voice is loud, nasal and bullying, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 1>.
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: a 25-year-old female cleaner, the taller of the two women and the broader-shouldered one. Preserve her exact face, small lean build, long centre-parted black hair tied into one low practical ponytail at the nape, plain dark-navy button-up work shirt buttoned up to the closed collar with its own small plain buttons down the front, a worn grey apron over dark navy trousers, black cloth shoes. Her face is slim with a high narrow cheekbone line and a long jaw. Her voice is low, steady and slightly hoarse, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 2>.
<Subject 3> — 小唐: a 22-year-old female cleaning-team colleague, the shorter of the two women and visibly younger. ⛔ Her face is clearly a different face from 苏小满 (S2): a small round face with full soft cheeks, wide-set round eyes, a short flat nose, a small closed mouth, a short thin neck and narrow sloping shoulders. ⛔ Her hair is tied back in one low ponytail, the same style as 苏小满 (S2), so her hair is not what tells them apart. She wears a light-grey button-up work shirt with a pointed collar, light-grey trousers and a light-grey apron, a noticeably paler grey than the dark navy worn by 苏小满 (S2). Her voice is small, thin and nervous. It is the person shown in <Picture 3>.

<Picture 4>: the office layout reference for 万山大厦 — this same single room is the set for the whole clip. Light-oak storage cabinets along the back-left wall with plain brown cardboard boxes stacked on top; a low wooden credenza under the back window with a printer, files and two potted green plants; an L-shaped wooden office desk with a black monitor, keyboard and document tray in the middle of the room, a black swivel chair pushed in; a grey fabric sofa with wooden armrests and a low wooden coffee table under the long window on the right; an open doorway with a grey metal frame on the left. Pale grey polished tile floor, white acoustic ceiling with recessed light panels.

summary:
[reference generation] Pressed from the wall, the young colleague gives a deliberately vague testimony, and the manager takes it as proof.

retention_analysis:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: fully_preserved - his slicked-back oily hair, round face, heavy-lidded eyes, broad nose and heavy jaw stay identical in every shot, and he is the only man in the clip.
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: fully_preserved - her slim high-cheekbone face, almond eyes, straight nose and long centre-parted black hair tied into one low practical ponytail at the nape stay identical in every shot.
<Subject 3> — 小唐: fully_preserved - her small round face with full soft cheeks, wide-set round eyes, short flat nose, small closed mouth, thin neck and narrow sloping shoulders stay identical in every shot, and she stays clearly a different person from 苏小满 in face shape, in height and in the light grey of her uniform against 苏小满's dark navy.
<Picture 4>: fully_preserved - light-oak cabinets, L-shaped desk, grey sofa on the right, doorway on the left

detailed_description:
HORIZONTAL 4:3 landscape framing, high-key commercial cinematography, soft broad daylight, luminous pale walls, refined natural faces. Keep the film texture, natural lighting, every face, every costume and the realistic motion consistent throughout. People stay standing, framed from the knees up. The camera is locked off for the whole clip: the framing never changes and the size of everything in frame stays the same from the first frame to the last. All movement comes from the people inside the fixed frame.
Exposure: a large window is the key light and soft bounced daylight fills the room; skin tones are bright and even, shadows sit in the light mid-tones, the whites stay white, and the picture carries an even high-key brightness from edge to edge. Every shirt is buttoned to the closed collar, so each chest shows one unbroken run of plain fabric with small plain buttons; apron bibs are plain.
Speaker labels for this shot only: (S1) 钱经理, (S2) 苏小满, (S3) 小唐. Anyone not named here stays silent with a closed mouth.
The whole clip takes place in the one office shown in <Picture 4>, and the three of them hold these same standing places from the first frame to the last: 钱经理 (S1) behind the L-shaped desk in the middle of the room, his body square to the desk and his head turned to the right, his eyes locked on 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of that desk and not on 小唐 (S3) beside the sofa; 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of that desk in right profile facing right towards him, both feet flat on the tile; 小唐 (S3) on the right side of the room beside the grey sofa in left profile, facing left towards the desk.
ONE CONTINUOUS TAKE, medium three-shot on 钱经理 (S1), 苏小满 (S2) and 小唐 (S3) in the middle of the room, framed from the knees up, camera locked off for all ten seconds: 小唐 (S3) stands beside the grey sofa at frame right in left profile facing left towards the desk, and her eyes stay cast down at the floor with her head lowered away from the desk the whole time she talks, her fingers tightening on the sofa's wooden arm; she speaks in a small thin nervous voice with her mouth moving clearly: 小唐 (S3) speaks: [Chinese] 没看清。 钱经理 (S1) is behind the L-shaped desk with his body square to the desk and his head turned to the right, his eyes locked on 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of that desk and not on 小唐 (S3) beside the sofa; he keeps his mouth closed and he does not move; 苏小满 (S2) stands at the near left corner of the desk in right profile facing right towards him, both feet flat on the tile, her mouth closed, waiting. The framing never changes once: the same three people stay visible in the same three places at the same size from the first frame to the last, and the open doorway at frame left shows only the corridor wall beyond it.

No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; ⛔ The clip is shot as one single unbroken take with no cuts at all: the camera never cuts away, never changes lens, never changes height, and never changes framing. No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no camera moves, and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.
overall_soundscape: A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; a small clearing of throat from 小唐 at 2.4s before she speaks; one sharp breath from 苏小满 at 5.2s; room tone settles at 7.0s.

non_diegetic_music: A low sustained string drone begins at 0s, a single muted piano note enters at 1.3s when the manager beckons, and the track thins from 5.0s to one held note.
